              <h2 class="h1">Rooted in Cambodian botanicals</h2>
              <hr class="abj-rule my-3"/>
              <p>ABJ Skincare was born in Ta Khmau from a simple frustration: skincare made for other climates doesn't work in ours. Heavy creams melt, harsh actives sting, and fragrance hides what formulas lack.</p>
              <p>So we build every product around three rules: <strong>clinically dosed actives</strong>, <strong>weightless tropical-proof textures</strong>, and <strong>botanicals grown close to home</strong> &#8212; lotus, jasmine, rice and green tea.</p>
              <a href="/about-us" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">Read our story</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
